	(text "ASM1153E runs from 5 V only (the brain's always-on 5V_HDD rail through the edge): VBUS_LDO -> VCCO (3.3 V) and VCCIN -> LXI switcher -> 1.05 V core."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 276 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "12ea8ce8-9be3-562a-967b-604b1aeb843f")
	)
	(text "Clock straps GPIO3/GPIO7 at their internal pull-up default (11) = 30 MHz crystal. GPIO6 default = I2C mode, no SPI ROM. Bay activity LED assumed on GPIO0 (verify on the bench); it sinks the brain's LED through the edge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
